; Registry entries for the Intel e1000 adapter and for the network components
; it depends on. This file is included in the Live CD hives only, so it never
; reaches the registry of an installed system. mkhive only understands the
; [AddReg] section and absolute HKLM key names, so no HKR or AddService
; entries are used here.

[AddReg]
; e1000 adapter as a critical device (Live CD has no PnP installer)
